ion\",\"settings\":{\"layout\":\"full_width\",\"gap\":\"no\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c9abcf1\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"f0c137b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"3\"},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"},\"grid_rows_grid_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"},\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":91},\"min_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":308,\"sizes\":[]},\"_flex_size\":\"none\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c18c09a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h2><strong><span style=\\\"font-size: 21px;\\\">Qui Sommes-Nous<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/h2><p>Le Congo Leadership Institute existe <br \\/>depuis f\\u00e9vrier 2014. Il a pour objectifs :<br \\/><span style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\"><strong>\\u2022<\\/strong><\\/span> Encadrer des leaders afin que ces <br \\/>derniers r\\u00e9alisent leur plus grand <br \\/>potentiel ;<br \\/><span style=\\\"font-size: 20px;\\\"><strong>\\u2022<\\/strong><\\/span> Contribuer au d\\u00e9veloppement de la RDC <br \\/>et ainsi participer changement du <br \\/>monde au travers des organisation <br \\/>rayonnante, comp\\u00e9titives et rentables.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"f2a66cd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h2><strong><span style=\\\"font-size: 21px;\\\">Notre Vision<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/h2><p>La vision de CLI est d\\u2019\\u00eatre l\\u2019outil de r\\u00e9f\\u00e9rence d\\u2019encadrement des leaders congolais ( et dans la sous-r\\u00e9gion des grands lacs) en les accompagnant dans le d\\u00e9veloppement des qualit\\u00e9s d\\u2019un leadership responsable avec la finalit\\u00e9 de transformer notre pays et contribuer <br \\/>par ricochet au changement du monde au <br \\/>travers des organisation rayonnante, <br \\/>comp\\u00e9titives et rentables<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"07f1d1d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h2><strong><span style=\\\"font-size: 21px;\\\">Notre Mission<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/h2><p>CLI existe pour accompagner au travers la formation et encadrement un nouveau type de leaders qui sera au centre du d\\u00e9veloppement de notre pays sur le plan politique, \\u00e9conomique, des affaires, religieux, humanitaire, scientifique, etc.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"2272964\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"100\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"100\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dd383dd\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9080c0a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"sec_title\":\"Nos services\",\"sec_content\":\"Nous offrons les services suivants calibr\\u00e9s \\nselon les besoins de nos clients\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"edumel-title\"},{\"id\":\"74e35ab\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"structure\":\"20\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c92dc49\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":58.329999999999998,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"12\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_inline_size_tablet\":100,\"_inline_size_mobile\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"57c2c7b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"step_icon\":\"01\",\"s