anisation rayonnante, <br \\/>comp\\u00e9titives et rentables<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"07f1d1d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h2><strong><span style=\\\"font-size: 21px;\\\">Notre Mission<\\/span><\\/strong><\\/h2><p>CLI existe pour accompagner au travers la formation et encadrement un nouveau type de leaders qui sera au centre du d\\u00e9veloppement de notre pays sur le plan politique, \\u00e9conomique, des affaires, religieux, humanitaire, scientifique, etc.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"2272964\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"100\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"100\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"dd383dd\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100,\"_inline_size\":null,\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"9080c0a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"sec_title\":\"Nos services\",\"sec_content\":\"Nous offrons les services suivants calibr\\u00e9s \\nselon les besoins de nos clients\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"40\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"15\",\"left\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"edumel-title\"},{\"id\":\"74e35ab\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"gap\":\"no\",\"structure\":\"20\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c92dc49\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":50,\"_inline_size\":58.329999999999998,\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"12\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_inline_size_tablet\":100,\"_inline_size_mobile\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"57c2c7b\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"step_icon\":\"01\",\"s