mber #1 programming language that powers the internet? Are you tired of wasting your time and money on random youtube videos or JavaScript courses that are either too simple, or too difficult to follow? Or are you struggling to deeply understand and apply JavaScript to real projects? If your answer is a big YES... Then this is exactly the course you are looking for!',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'the-complete-javascript-course-2019-build-real-projects',	'',	'',	'2019-05-17 09:33:38',	'2019-05-17 09:33:38',	'',	0,	'https://demo.themeum.com/wordpress/edumax/?post_type=course&amp;p=268',	0,	'courses',	'',	0),
