de you through every single step from installation to finished website.  I\'ll show you how you can install Wordpress on your own computer for free, so you don\'t have to pay for a domain name or hosting fees while you complete this course.  Once you\'ve got Wordpress installed on your computer, you will learn how to build and run a successful, beautiful, responsive-design website you can be proud of. ',	'publish',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'wordpress-for-beginners-master-wordpress-quickly',	'',	'',	'2019-05-17 09:44:58',	'2019-05-17 09:44:58',	'',	0,	'https://demo.themeum.com/wordpress/edumax/?post_type=course&amp;p=292',	0,	'courses',	'',	0),
