wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It also gives you insights on your market’s behavior such as location, times of activity, frequency of searches, technologies used, product preferences, etc. All these metrics are useful in helping you get to know your audience.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lo managed to make it hers for $28 million.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Ultricies porta Donec urna, faucib</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Lo managed to make it hers for $28 million. As the Bronx native acquires</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>The property, complete with a 30-seat screening room, a 100-seat amphit</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->',	'Google Ads certifications: Are they worth it?',	'',	'publish',	'open',	'open',	'',	'google-ads-certifications-are-they-worth-it',	'',	'',	'2025-05-05 10:03:23',	'2025-05-05 10:03:23',	'',	0,	'https://pxelcode.com/wp/edumel/?p=918',	0,	'post',	'',	0),
