ts/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />						\n														John Doe\n																						Designer\n							Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.\n							<img src=\"http://cli.local/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />						\n														John Doe\n																						Designer\n							Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.\n							<img src=\"http://cli.local/wp-content/plugins/elementor/assets/images/placeholder.png\" title=\"\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" />						\n														John Doe\n																						Designer\n								<section>\n										   <img src=\"http://cli.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/photo-2.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n											<h2>Vous souhaitez connaitre les offres spéciales et les mises à jour des nouvelles formations ?</h2>\n																						<a href=\"#\">Rejoignez-nous</a>\n			</section>',	'Accueil',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'20-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2025-10-07 14:02:48',	'2025-10-07 14:02:48',	'',	20,	'http://cli.local/?p=1357',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
