	Marketing Manager\n													<p>Cras vel purus fringilla, lobortis libero ut Proin a velit convallis, fermentum orci in, rutrum diam. Duis elementum odio a pharetra commodo.</p>\n														<img width=\"140\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cli.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/testimonial-avata-02-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />													\n														<h4>Jackie Sanders</h4>\n														Marketing Manager\n													<p>Cras vel purus fringilla, lobortis libero ut Proin a velit convallis, fermentum orci in, rutrum diam. Duis elementum odio a pharetra commodo.</p>\n														<img width=\"140\" height=\"140\" src=\"http://cli.local/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/testimonial-avata-04-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" />													\n														<h4>Cory Zamora</h4>\n														Marketing Manager\n		</section>\n		<!-- Testimonial section End -->			\n								<section>\n										   <img src=\"http://cli.local/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/photo-2.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n											<h2>Vous souhaitez connaitre les offres spéciales et les mises à jour des nouvelles formations ?</h2>\n																						<a href=\"#\">Rejoignez-nous</a>\n			</section>',	'Accueil',	'',	'inherit',	'closed',	'closed',	'',	'20-revision-v1',	'',	'',	'2025-10-07 19:42:11',	'2025-10-07 19:42:11',	'',	20,	'http://cli.local/?p=1459',	0,	'revision',	'',	0),
